This is a project which will help me learn cheat sheets and practice text manipulation in NeoVim simultaneously

The ultimate goal is to make a simple game which:
1. Alters a text file
2. Opens the original text file in read only mode and the altered file in write mode
3. Records the time and amount of keystrokes made until both are identical again
4. The goal of this game is to "fix" the changed file as quickly or efficiently as possible

